---
---

<section id="problem" class="problem-section">
  <div class="container-zine">
    <div class="problem-ledger-header">
      <span class="stamp-badge">02 // THE PROBLEM</span>
      <span class="ledger-annotation">THE ASYMMETRY OF MEDIA CONSUMPTION</span>
    </div>

    <div class="problem-card">
      <div class="tape-strip tape-top-center"></div>
      
      <p class="problem-lead-tag type-mono-sm">UNSPOKEN REALITY FOR MODERN EDUCATORS</p>
      
      <h2 class="problem-statement type-punch-lg">
        YOUR BEST VIDEO LIVES ON <span class="invert-block">ONE PLATFORM.</span><br />
        YOUR READERS LIVE ON <span class="highlighter-text hl-mark">FIVE.</span>
      </h2>

      <div class="problem-notes-grid">
        <div class="note-box">
          <div class="note-label type-mono-sm">[01] THE ATTENTION SPLIT</div>
          <p class="type-serif-body">
            High-net-worth investors, CXOs, and tech founders rarely sit through a 34-minute YouTube video. They scan executive summaries, save X threads at dawn, and read newsletters before opening their inbox.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="note-box">
          <div class="note-label type-mono-sm">[02] THE REPURPOSING TRAP</div>
          <p class="type-serif-body">
            Generic AI tools generate bland bullet-point slop that kills creator trust. Real editorial requires print-grade taste: excavating the counter-intuitive hooks and mathematical proofs that make people hit <em>Share</em>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .problem-section {
    padding-top: var(--sp-6);
    padding-bottom: var(--sp-6);
    background-color: var(--paper-base);
    border-bottom: var(--border-thick);
  }

  .problem-ledger-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-3);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--sp-2);
  }

  .ledger-annotation {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .problem-card {
    background-color: var(--paper-sheet);
    border: var(--border-heavy);
    padding: clamp(24px, 5vw, 48px);
    position: relative;
  }

  .problem-lead-tag {
    color: var(--accent-vermilion);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-2);
  }

  .problem-statement {
    color: var(--ink-black);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-5);
  }

  .invert-block {
    background-color: var(--ink-black);
    color: var(--paper-sheet);
    padding: 0 8px;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .hl-mark {
    background-color: var(--accent-highlighter);
    color: var(--ink-black);
    padding: 0 8px;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .problem-notes-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--sp-4);
    border-top: var(--border-thick);
    padding-top: var(--sp-4);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .problem-notes-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  .note-box {
    background-color: var(--paper-sunken);
    border: var(--border-thick);
    padding: var(--sp-3);
  }

  .note-label {
    color: var(--accent-vermilion);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
</style>
